  "description": "Renders syntax-highlighted source code inside Dear ImGui. Ships a data-driven tokenizer with definitions for fifteen languages, theme-aware palettes that follow the host application's light or dark theme, an optional line-number gutter, and cached tokenization for immediate-mode render loops. Layered on ktsu.ImGui.Color only, with no dependency on ktsu.ImGui.App, so it drops into any Hexa.NET.ImGui application — including as the code-block renderer for ktsu.ImGui.Markdown.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
